# Semgrep skip list. Complements .gitignore (which `semgrep scan` already honours):
# generated trees that a local working copy holds even when git does not, so a laptop
# run and a CI checkout scan the same files. Do not add source paths here to silence
# a finding - annotate the finding with `nosemgrep:` and a reason, the way
# OpenApiExport.WriteAsync and the format-on-edit hook already do.
node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.next/
coverage/
TestResults/
*.min.js
.terraform/
